; Kurogane's moveset: the standard frame data, on the armored pack's clips.
;
; Every gameplay number here is copied from standard.tres unchanged -- damage,
; startup, knockback, hitboxes, cancels. The only differences are which clip
; each move plays and where in it contact lands, because the two packs animate
; the same moves at different times and a slice tuned to one lands mid-wind-up
; on the other.
;
; Contact times came from tools/analyse_impacts.gd, which samples every frame
; and reports where each hand reaches furthest and each foot goes highest -- a
; punch connects at full extension, a kick at the top of its arc. They are a
; first pass: nudge them here rather than in code if a move reads late.

[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="MoveSet" load_steps=11 format=3]

